                <h2 className="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-serif font-bold mb-8 italic">Welcome to the Wilderness</h2>
                <div className="w-24 h-1 bg-wild-lime mx-auto mb-10"></div>
                <p className="text-gray-400 text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed font-light">
                  Wilpattu Wild Camping offers an authentic wildlife adventure in the heart of Sri Lanka's largest national park. 
                  Immerse yourself in nature with our luxury tented accommodations and private safari experiences led by professional naturalists.
                </p>
              </div>

              <div className="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
                <div className="order-2 md:order-1">
                  <h3 className="text-3xl font-serif font-bold mb-6">Experience the Majesty of <br/><span className="text-wild-lime">The Jungle King</span></h3>
                  <p className="text-gray-400 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
                    Wilpattu is unique for its "villus" (natural lakes) which attract a diverse range of wildlife including leopards, elephants, and sloth bears. Our camping experiences are designed to get you closer to the heartbeat of the wild without sacrificing comfort.
                  </p>
                  <div className="grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-10">
                    <div className="flex items-start gap-4">
                       <i className="fa-solid fa-leaf text-wild-lime text-2xl mt-1"></i>
                       <div>
                         <h5 className="font-bold">Eco-Friendly</h5>
                         <p className="text-xs text-gray-500">Sustainable tourism practices</p>
                       </div>
                    </div>
                    <div className="flex items-start gap-4">
                       <i className="fa-solid fa-hotel text-wild-lime text-2xl mt-1"></i>
                       <div>
                         <h5 className="font-bold">Luxury Tents</h5>
                         <p className="text-xs text-gray-500">Premium comfort in the wild</p>
                       </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <button 
                    onClick={() => setActiveSection(AppSection.ABOUT)}
                    className="border-b-2 border-wild-lime pb-1 text-sm font-bold hover:text-wild-lime transition-colors"
                  >
                    LEARN MORE ABOUT OUR MISSION
                  </button>
                </div>
                <div className="order-1 md:order-2 relative group">
                  <div className="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl">
                    <img 
                      src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1547407139-3c921a66005c?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=800" 
                      className="rounded-2xl shadow-2xl z-10 relative group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-1000"
                      alt="Leopard"
                    />
                  </div>
                  <div className="absolute -top-6 -right-6 w-32 h-32 bg-wild-lime/20 rounded-full blur-3xl group-hover:bg-wild-lime/30 transition-all"></div>
